1. Overview
-----------
This project references LVGL through Git submodules. The LVGL source code and
its bundled font files are NOT copied into this repository; they are fetched
from the official LVGL repository and pinned to the exact tags declared in
.gitmodules.

After cloning, initialize the submodules with:

    git submodule update --init --recursive


